    "title": "Multiple I-5 Ramp Closures in Douglas County Thru April - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By I-5 Exit Guide ,\n9 hours ago The Oregon Department of Transportation (ODOT) reports that construction on an I-5 safety project will lead to short nighttime closures of more than 40 off-ramps in Douglas County through the end of April. ODOT contractors have been working since last summer to install signs, pavement markers and other safety features... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
